{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't Let It Starve</strong> is a strategy rogue-lite game where you must prepare the most satisfying bentos for a half-chef monster lurking in the ventilation ducts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930510/extras/0dcd83786b55c284452e6a0433fb6220.avif?t=1772207768\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grid-Based Bento Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare bentos by arranging food in a grid.<br>Choose ingredients wisely and optimize your layout to fit as much as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930510/extras/2e1794344a3ec78d01f2348d382c1b02.poster.avif?t=1772207768\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930510/extras/2e1794344a3ec78d01f2348d382c1b02.webm?t=1772207768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930510/extras/2e1794344a3ec78d01f2348d382c1b02.mp4?t=1772207768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match dozens of tools and effects.<br>Each run is unique, with countless ways to stay alive\u2026 or fail horribly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930510/extras/917a627ff4b7678d14c8067b4220e9ac.poster.avif?t=1772207768\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930510/extras/917a627ff4b7678d14c8067b4220e9ac.webm?t=1772207768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930510/extras/917a627ff4b7678d14c8067b4220e9ac.mp4?t=1772207768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Satisfying Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy better tools, pick the best ingredients, and push your food points to the max.<br>The more you please the creature, the longer you live.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930510/extras/d9dd7431164a81fb2a70ceec38b02d52.avif?t=1772207768\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta-Progression</strong> \u2013 Unlock new tools, upgrades, and run modifiers that change future attempts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>120+ Unique Items &amp; Synergies</strong> \u2013 Experiment with a huge variety of tools and effects to create deadly-efficient strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong> \u2013 Push your skills (and your luck) to the limit in an infinite survival challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 You're not alone in the kitchen. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3930510?t=1772207768","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930510/5315fc90f3ef5c0cac90393af39e7715fd30f067/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772207768","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930510/6e82fcf58bbb57e13f3945c9bfd8e57901e12b72/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772207768","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930510/6e82fcf58bbb57e13f3945c9bfd8e57901e12b72/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=177220776